    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Sons of Earth knew exactly what they were doing\u2026  a sleeper cell\u2026
    they worked on the station. No wonder no one saw it coming\u2026\n\n\nLooking
    at the recording, their target was the officer. But what did they want with him?
    Why abduct him\u2026 I need to find out who he was... There\u2019s got to be
    a place with an active personnel list\u2026\n\n\nI\u2019ll try Everest.\n"
