  m_Text: 'Hey Cap, thought I let you know, the station is pretty much gone. I''m
    updating the personnel list and crew status... gonna gray out the second one
    pretty soon (x_x). Watch out for Dom and Lang, they took Arthur... god knows
    where... anyway, it was great working with you, but you know that already :)



    Metze
    out!'
